{"route":"/docs/6.0/components/stepper/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Stepper","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Create timelines, wizards, or step-by-step progress bars. Ideal for shopping carts, sign-up forms, and more."},"blocks":[{"id":"examples","type":"heading","en":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"examples--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Stepper is built with CSS Grid and <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code> elements. By default, steps are displayed vertically. You can transform them into horizontal lists with responsive modifier classes."},{"id":"basic","type":"heading","en":"Basic","level":3},{"id":"basic--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Here’s a simple example of a vertical stepper."},{"id":"basic--example-1","type":"demo","key":"776a8bddbf1396091141","height":147},{"id":"basic--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"stepper\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"responsive","type":"heading","en":"Responsive","level":3},{"id":"responsive--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Steppers can be made horizontal at specific breakpoints using the <code>contains-inline</code> utility on a parent element and by adding the responsive <code>.stepper-horizontal-{breakpoint}</code> modifier classes on the stepper. The extra parent element is required when using container queries."},{"id":"responsive--example-1","type":"demo","key":"73b584f87e8d09afb6b8","height":147},{"id":"responsive--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"contains-inline\">\n  <ol class=\"stepper sm:stepper-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n  </ol>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"gap","type":"heading","en":"Gap","level":3},{"id":"gap--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Customize the gap with styles that override the <code>--bs-stepper-gap</code> CSS variable."},{"id":"gap--example-1","type":"demo","key":"a16342e15ae8a75dfb8b","height":147},{"id":"gap--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"stepper\" style=\"--bs-stepper-gap: 3rem\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"variants","type":"heading","en":"Variants","level":2},{"id":"variants--example-1","type":"demo","key":"fcd3c82f8c162b58e63c","height":147},{"id":"variants--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active theme-accent\">Create account</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active theme-success\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active theme-danger\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"overflow","type":"heading","en":"Overflow","level":2},{"id":"overflow--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap your horizontal stepper in a <code>.stepper-overflow</code> container to enable horizontal scrolling when the stepper overflows its parent. Uses <code>container-type: inline-size</code> for container query support as opposed to a viewport-based media query."},{"id":"overflow--example-1","type":"demo","key":"1d98f3240f93bb5d80f1","height":147},{"id":"overflow--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"stepper-overflow\">\n  <ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Verify email address</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Complete profile setup</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Add payment method</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Review and confirm</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish onboarding</li>\n  </ol>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"complex","type":"heading","en":"Complex","level":2},{"id":"complex--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add additional content beyond labels to provide more context within each step, such as descriptions, helper messages, status indicators, or other decorative elements."},{"id":"complex--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c47c928f0a80619e2c26","height":147},{"id":"complex--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-vertical\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item align-items-start active\">\n    <div class=\"pt-1\">\n      <div class=\"fw-semibold\">Create</div>\n      <small class=\"fg-3\">Create an account.</small>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item align-items-start active\">\n    <div class=\"pt-1\">\n      <div class=\"fw-semibold\">Confirm</div>\n      <small class=\"fg-3\">Confirm your email.</small>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item align-items-start\">\n    <div class=\"pt-1\">\n      <div class=\"fw-semibold\">Set-up</div>\n      <small class=\"fg-3\">Configure your profile.</small>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item align-items-start\">\n    <div class=\"pt-1\">\n      <div class=\"fw-semibold\">Finish</div>\n      <small class=\"fg-3\">Welcome aboard!</small>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"complex--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Mix with other components, like badges, and our theme helpers to create a more unique steppers."},{"id":"complex--example-2","type":"demo","key":"13415e9cc9f80ff845f5","height":147},{"id":"complex--code-2","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal w-100\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item theme-success active\">\n    <div>\n      <div>Create account</div>\n      <div class=\"badge badge-subtle\">Complete</div>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item theme-success active\">\n    <div>\n      <div>Confirm email</div>\n      <div class=\"badge badge-subtle\">Complete</div>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item theme-primary active\">\n    <div>\n      <div>Update profile</div>\n      <div class=\"badge badge-subtle\">In-progress</div>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item theme-secondary\">\n    <div>\n      <div>Finish</div>\n      <div class=\"badge badge-subtle\">Pending</div>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"alignment","type":"heading","en":"Alignment","level":2},{"id":"alignment--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/text-alignment\">text alignment utilities</a> (because we use <code>display: inline-grid</code>) to align the steps. The inline grid arrangement allows us to keep the steps equal width and ensures the connecting lines are rendered correctly."},{"id":"alignment--example-1","type":"demo","key":"9dd8dfff967ed2fdd4cf","height":147},{"id":"alignment--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Default stepper</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"alignment--example-2","type":"demo","key":"16613c0fb40ebdba6e6b","height":147},{"id":"alignment--code-2","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Center stepper</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"alignment--example-3","type":"demo","key":"7b700911b247865c38de","height":147},{"id":"alignment--code-3","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">End stepper</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"alignment--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Apply <code>.w-100</code> to the stepper to make it full width. Stepper items will be stretched to fill the available space. Alignment doesn’t affect full-width steppers."},{"id":"alignment--example-4","type":"demo","key":"80bdae6c7e153420bcd5","height":147},{"id":"alignment--code-4","type":"code","value":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal w-100\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","language":""},{"id":"with-anchors","type":"heading","en":"With anchors","level":2},{"id":"with-anchors--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use anchor elements to build your stepper if it links across multiple pages. Add <code>role=&quot;button&quot;</code> or use <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> elements if you’re linking across sections in the same document."},{"id":"with-anchors--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Consider using our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/link\">link utilities</a> for quick color control."},{"id":"with-anchors--example-1","type":"demo","key":"5e06090579c20f0d84f7","height":147},{"id":"with-anchors--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"stepper\">\n  <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"stepper-item theme-secondary\">Update profile</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"stepper-item theme-secondary\">Finish</a>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Steppers use local CSS variables on <code>.stepper</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$stepper-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --stepper-size: 2rem,\n    --stepper-gap: 1rem,\n    --stepper-font-size: var(--font-size-sm),\n    --stepper-text-gap: .5rem,\n    --stepper-track-size: .125rem,\n    --stepper-bg: var(--bg-2),\n    --stepper-active-color: var(--primary-contrast),\n    --stepper-active-bg: var(--primary-bg),\n  ),\n  $stepper-tokens\n);","language":""},{"id":"sass-mixin","type":"heading","en":"Sass mixin","level":3},{"id":"sass-mixin--code-1","type":"code","value":"@mixin stepper-horizontal() {\n  display: inline-grid;\n  grid-auto-columns: 1fr;\n  grid-auto-flow: column;\n\n  .stepper-item {\n    grid-template-rows: var(--stepper-size) auto;\n    grid-template-columns: auto;\n    align-items: start;\n    justify-items: center;\n    text-align: center;\n\n    &::after {\n      inset-block-start: calc((var(--stepper-size) * .5) - (var(--stepper-track-size) * .5));\n      inset-block-end: auto;\n      inset-inline-start: 50%;\n      inset-inline-end: 100%;\n      width: calc(100% + var(--stepper-gap));\n      height: var(--stepper-track-size);\n    }\n\n    &:last-child::after {\n      right: 100%;\n    }\n  }\n}","language":""},{"id":"overflow-wrapper","type":"heading","en":"Overflow wrapper","level":3},{"id":"overflow-wrapper--code-1","type":"code","value":".stepper-overflow {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  overscroll-behavior-x: contain;\n  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n\n  > .stepper {\n    width: max-content;\n    min-width: 100%;\n  }\n}","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"776a8bddbf1396091141","html":"<ol class=\"stepper\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"73b584f87e8d09afb6b8","html":"<div class=\"bd-resizable-container bg-body border border-keyline shadow-xs\" style=\"width: 100%; min-width: 200px;\"><div class=\"contains-inline\">\n  <ol class=\"stepper sm:stepper-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n  </ol>\n</div></div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bd-example-resizable bg-1"},"sprite":""},{"key":"a16342e15ae8a75dfb8b","html":"<ol class=\"stepper\" style=\"--bs-stepper-gap: 3rem\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fcd3c82f8c162b58e63c","html":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active theme-accent\">Create account</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active theme-success\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active theme-danger\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"1d98f3240f93bb5d80f1","html":"<div class=\"stepper-overflow\">\n  <ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n    <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Verify email address</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Complete profile setup</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Add payment method</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Review and confirm</li>\n    <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish onboarding</li>\n  </ol>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"c47c928f0a80619e2c26","html":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-vertical\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item align-items-start active\">\n    <div class=\"pt-1\">\n      <div class=\"fw-semibold\">Create</div>\n      <small class=\"fg-3\">Create an account.</small>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item align-items-start active\">\n    <div class=\"pt-1\">\n      <div class=\"fw-semibold\">Confirm</div>\n      <small class=\"fg-3\">Confirm your email.</small>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item align-items-start\">\n    <div class=\"pt-1\">\n      <div class=\"fw-semibold\">Set-up</div>\n      <small class=\"fg-3\">Configure your profile.</small>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item align-items-start\">\n    <div class=\"pt-1\">\n      <div class=\"fw-semibold\">Finish</div>\n      <small class=\"fg-3\">Welcome aboard!</small>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ol>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"13415e9cc9f80ff845f5","html":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal w-100\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item theme-success active\">\n    <div>\n      <div>Create account</div>\n      <div class=\"badge badge-subtle\">Complete</div>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item theme-success active\">\n    <div>\n      <div>Confirm email</div>\n      <div class=\"badge badge-subtle\">Complete</div>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item theme-primary active\">\n    <div>\n      <div>Update profile</div>\n      <div class=\"badge badge-subtle\">In-progress</div>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item theme-secondary\">\n    <div>\n      <div>Finish</div>\n      <div class=\"badge badge-subtle\">Pending</div>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ol>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"9dd8dfff967ed2fdd4cf","html":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Default stepper</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"16613c0fb40ebdba6e6b","html":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Center stepper</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example text-center"},"sprite":""},{"key":"7b700911b247865c38de","html":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">End stepper</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example text-end"},"sprite":""},{"key":"80bdae6c7e153420bcd5","html":"<ol class=\"stepper stepper-horizontal w-100\">\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Update profile</li>\n  <li class=\"stepper-item\">Finish</li>\n</ol>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"5e06090579c20f0d84f7","html":"<div class=\"stepper\">\n  <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"stepper-item active\">Create account</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"stepper-item active\">Confirm email</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"stepper-item theme-secondary\">Update profile</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"stepper-item theme-secondary\">Finish</a>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Install","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/install"},{"en":"AI","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/ai"},{"en":"Approach","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/approach"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/css-variables"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"